# 🧩 Scrolling Code Demo

A lightweight HTML/JS/CSS snippet that simulates a scrolling terminal effect—perfect for teaching, showcasing UI polish, or adding flair to your site.

## 🚀 Features

- Sequential or random line display
- Modular structure (HTML, CSS, JS)
- Easy to customize with your own pseudo-code or product names
- Teachable logic for beginners and educators

## 📦 Files

- `index.html` — basic layout and container
- `style.css` — styling for the scrolling effect
- `script.js` — logic for line generation and animation

